  Description: Your armor has so many adjustments and precautions that it can guard
    against all physical damage. While wearing your armor, you gain resistance to
    all physical damage (bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage, as well as persistent
    bleed damage) equal to half your level. You must have the dense plating, layered
    mesh, or tensile absorption breakthrough modification to select this modification.
